---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact & Booking — Splatter Phoenix" description="Contact Splatter Phoenix for booking, shows, press, and general inquiries.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Booking · Press · Hello" title="Get in touch" intro="Want Splatter Phoenix on the bill, in your publication, or in your town? Send the details and let’s talk." />
  <section class="shell contact-grid section-pad">
    <div class="contact-card hot-card"><p class="eyebrow">Booking</p><h2>Put us<br />on the bill.</h2><p>Venue, date, city, lineup, and any production details help us respond faster. For this draft, booking inquiries route through the band’s official Instagram.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="https://www.instagram.com/splatter_phoenix_rva/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Message the band ↗</a></div>
    <div class="contact-card"><p class="eyebrow">Online</p><h2>Find the band</h2><div class="contact-links"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/splatter_phoenix_rva/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61552065852237" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Facebook ↗</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@SplatterPhoenix" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">YouTube ↗</a><a href="/press">Electronic press kit →</a></div><p class="fine-print">A dedicated booking email or contact form can replace the temporary Instagram route before launch.</p></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
